@format 1
@id audio.toggle-step
@title Change audio processing setting
@area Audio
@entry input
@summary Apply one audio inspector setting change to the tab, refresh active-step state and monitoring data, then request plan persistence.
@flow TB
@related audio.save-plan, audio.select-step

@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PAudioTab
@alias inspector = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PInspector
@alias monitor = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.LSMonitor

[input] Audio setting changes <input>
- Publish an active-state or parameter change from the audio inspector @ inspector.PInspectorActiveRaise(...)
> update

[update] Update audio surface <process>
- Refresh every processing-row active indicator @ tab.PAudioActiveUpdate(...)
- Rebuild the monitor's planned audio chain @ monitor.LSMonitorPlanApply(...)
- Request sidecar-plan persistence for the current source @ tab.PAudioChangeHandle(...)
> persist

[persist] Continue to plan persistence <output>
> map:audio.save-plan
